  <h2>Engineering Recovery & Performance</h2>
  <p>True compression wear is a medical-grade science. Our R&D team utilizes specialized knitting patterns to create "graduated compression"—highest at the ankle and decreasing up the leg to assist blood flow.</p>

  <h3>Muscle Vibration Reduction</h3>
  <p>By using high-denier Nylon/Spandex blends (280+ GSM), we engineer leggings that reduce muscle oscillation during impact. This data is essential for brands targeting high-performance athletes in the UK and USA. As your <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong>, we provide the testing data to back your brand's claims.</p>

  <h3>Supply Chain Consistency</h3>
  <p>Maintaining the exact compression ratio across 10,000 units requires precision <strong>Inventory Management</strong> of yarn tension and machine calibration. We ensure every shipment handled by <strong>Global Logistics</strong> meets the exact performance spec of your original sample.</p>
</GuideLayout>
